        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-272" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-932" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#39FF14;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px; background-color: transparent; line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px; line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;The Sovereign Envoy&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Purpose:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Orchestrating the workspace and defining the &quot;Security Envelope&quot; for external and internal dependencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Workspace Mapping:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;This file defines the root of the Zig-side machine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;By including&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;84&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;.security = .{ .path = &quot;security&quot; }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;127&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;.dependencies&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;, it links the high-level build commands to the specialized security module.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Version &amp;amp; Toolchain Locking:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Setting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;37&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.minimum_zig_version = &quot;0.15.0&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;ensures that the system only builds on the latest stable compiler, preventing bugs caused by legacy behavior or unstable nightly features.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Reproducible Fingerprinting:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;33&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.fingerprint&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a unique ID for the entire package graph. It ensures that the build is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;120&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;reproducible&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;—anyone building this code in 2026 or beyond will get the exact same binary output, which is a requirement for a &quot;Sovereign Machine.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px; white-space: pre; line-height: 180%; color: rgb(123, 136, 161);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(123, 136, 161);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; white-space: normal; line-height: 180%;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Publish Set (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;.paths&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;This explicitly tells Zig which files are part of the build logic. By including the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;106&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;security&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;folder and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;126&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;build.zig&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, it ensures that all necessary scripts for the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;183&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;WARDEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;are packaged together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="600" width="280" x="8320" y="160" as="geometry" />
