t; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;and performance optimizations, ensuring the financial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;kernel is built on the most modern and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;secure foundation available.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;Safety Over Stealth (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;ghc-options&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt; The list of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;warnings (like &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;62&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;-Wincomplete-record-updates&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;94&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;-Wmissing-export-lists&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;) is set to high-alert.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;In a financial system, a warning 