        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-280" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-932" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#39FF14;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 180%; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;The Logic Auditor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Purpose:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; Defining the static analysis boundaries to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 180%; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;prevent code smells and manage structural complexity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 180%; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;API Agility:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; By setting &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;24&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;avoid-breaking-exported-api = false&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;, the system prioritizes logic purity and aggressive refactoring over legacy API stability—essential for the rapid evolution of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;191&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; kernel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 180%; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Complexity Guardrails:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; High thresholds for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;type complexity (250)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;69&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;argument counts (7)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; act as a &quot;circuit breaker&quot; against unreadable code, forcing developers to simplify abstractions before they become technical debt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 180%; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pragmatic Development:&lt;/b&gt; Temporarily relaxes documentation requirements while maintaining strict rules on &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;104&quot;&gt;binding names&lt;/b&gt;, ensuring that the code remains self-descriptive without slowing down initial development.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="600" width="280" x="80" y="1680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-276" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-932" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#39FF14;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The Visual Protocol&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Purpose:&lt;/b&gt; Enforcing a rigid aesthetic standard across the &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;57&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/code&gt; machine to ensure maximum auditability and logic clarity.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Foundation &amp;amp; Layout:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; Locks the codebase to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Edition 2021&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; with a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;63&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;120-character width&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;87&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Unix line endings&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;. This ensures that code remains readable on modern displays and consistent across Linux, Zig, and Haskell environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Audit-Ready Diffs:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; Features like &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;33&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;reordered imports&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;55&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;mandatory trailing commas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; in match blocks are designed for &quot;Clean Diffs.&quot; They minimize noise in version control, making it easy to track exactly how logic or financial states change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Security &amp;amp; Modernity:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; Prioritizes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;34&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;explicit FFI ABIs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; for secure cross-language calls and enforces &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;97&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;modern shorthands&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; (like &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;121&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;?&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; and field initialization). This strips away boilerplate noise, leaving only the &quot;Sovereign Logic&quot; visible to the auditor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="600" width="280" x="80" y="920" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-937" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-932" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#39FF14;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;white-space: pre; line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 180%;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;The Sovereign Source of Truth&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;white-space: normal; line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 180%;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Purpose:&lt;/b&gt; Centralized dependency management and strict version locking.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 180%;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Centralization:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; By placing crates like &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;39&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;memmap2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;48&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;serde&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;59&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;arkworks&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; here, we ensure every module uses the exact same binary version. This eliminates &quot;mismatched types&quot; errors when passing data between the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;205&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;MINT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;214&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;PRIVATE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; kernels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;white-space: normal; line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 180%;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Resolver 2:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; Essential for your &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;31&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Dual-Kernel (Rust/Zig)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; setup. It allows different feature sets for the same package depending on whether you are building for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;161&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;bench&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; (native) or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;179&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;contract&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; (WASM) targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;white-space: normal; line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 180%;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Standardization:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;21&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;[workspace.package]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; block ensures metadata—like your AGPL-3.0 license and authorship—remains immutable across the entire ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="600" width="280" x="80" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
