        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1231" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-990" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The &quot;Void Abacus&quot; and the Universal Standard of Measurement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;In &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;.rice OS&lt;/b&gt;, value is an abstract concept defined by the observer. &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;67&quot;&gt;currency.rs&lt;/code&gt; provides the &quot;Void Abacus&quot;—a mathematical engine that counts anything with absolute precision while remaining entirely agnostic to the nature of the asset being measured.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of the Agnostic Ledger:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The Label-Precision Duality:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every unit of value is defined by an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;66&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;AssetTag&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; consisting of a unique string label and a numerical precision. Whether it&#39;s &quot;AED&quot; with 2 decimals or &quot;TrustPoints&quot; with 0, the engine treats them with identical cryptographic rigor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Dynamic Asset Resolution:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Through the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;38&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;AssetRegistry&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; trait, the system decouples asset definitions from the execution engine. Precision rules can be injected at runtime from policy files, environmental context, or AI-driven dialogues, allowing the OS to adapt to any cultural or economic environment instantly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Invariant Arithmetic Safety:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;The engine enforces strict &quot;Domain Separation.&quot; You cannot add &quot;Gold&quot; to &quot;Silver&quot; or &quot;USD&quot; to &quot;AED&quot; without an explicit conversion layer. This prevents accidental value contamination in multi-asset portfolios.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Locale-Agnostic Core:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;By mandating ASCII-exact parsing, the core engine remains immune to regional formatting conflicts. Normalization happens at the edges (BARD/UI), ensuring the &quot;Golden Source&quot; of data is always mathematically clean.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Key Technical Highlights:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Precision-Guarded Construction:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;36&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;enforce_scale&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; mechanism ensures that no asset can ever carry more fractional data than its definition allows, preventing &quot;hidden inflation&quot; through rounding errors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Universal Serialization:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;29&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;AmountWire&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; format is fully self-describing, carrying the asset&#39;s metadata alongside its value to ensure consistency across distributed nodes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="560" width="600" x="120" y="920" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1232" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-990" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;align=right;strokeColor=#39FF14;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;schedule.rs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
