        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1249" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-990" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The &quot;Jurisdictional Firewall&quot; and Anti-Exploitation Layer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;In &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;.rice OS&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;legal.rs&lt;/code&gt; is the bridge between cryptographic sovereignty and state compliance. It ensures that every digital contract is not only mathematically sound but legally accountable, preventing predatory practices through automated structural audits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of the Legal Firewall:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Mandate Enforcement (The Surface Audit):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;The system performs a &quot;Surface Audit&quot; of every policy. Through &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;104&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;LegalManifest&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, it ensures that mandatory legal disclosures (mandates) are present in the document metadata, or it refuses to sign.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Fair-Exchange Guardianship:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;To eliminate &quot;IP Theft,&quot; the module monitors for code-related markers. When detected, it triggers a mandatory link to the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;150&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Ledger&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, requiring a verified escrow or payment limit. If the money isn&#39;t there, the code doesn&#39;t move.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Anti-Anonymity Anchoring:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Utilizing SEC1-encoded public keys, the system binds digital actors to verifiable legal identities. This eliminates &quot;ghost contracts,&quot; ensuring that every transaction can be traced back to a legally responsible entity via a registry reference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Semantic Legal Ingestion:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;The module uses a high-speed XML scanner (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;68&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;quick-xml&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;) tuned for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;89&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Akoma Ntoso&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; standards. This allows &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;124&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; to parse official government gazettes and extract articles, clauses, and compliance requirements as machine-readable anchors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Legal Compliance (Validation Suite):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;CEL Denylist:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; A firewall that prevents specific logic patterns (e.g., predatory interest or unauthorized data access) from being embedded in a policy rule.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Marker Analysis:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; A scanner that aggregates the entire policy surface—rules, metadata, and limits—to detect the &quot;intent&quot; of the document (e.g., is this a labor contract or a software license?).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Identity Verification:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; Deep validation of cryptographic signatures against state-attested public keys, ensuring the &quot;Who&quot; is as certain as the &quot;What.&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="560" width="600" x="120" y="6120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1250" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-990" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;align=right;strokeColor=#39FF14;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;engine.rs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="680" x="80" y="6760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1251" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-990" style="verticalLabelPosition=bottom;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#39FF14;shape=mxgraph.azure.script_file;pointerEvents=1;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fontStyle=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="39" width="37.05" x="88" y="6760" as="geometry" />
