        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1301" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1002" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The &quot;Sovereign Memory&quot; — Persistence Matrix&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;In &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;.rice OS&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;state.rs&lt;/code&gt; defines the immutable geometry of the &quot;Egg&#39;s&quot; interior. It serves as the bridge between the transient execution of the &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;141&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/code&gt; VM and the permanent ledger of the blockchain. By centralizing all storage keys and utilizing snapshotting strategies, this module ensures that the memory of your business logic is versioned, auditable, and structurally shielded from state corruption.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of the Sovereign Memory:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Key-Space Centralization:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Wszystkie klucze (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;44&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;CONFIG_KEY&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;56&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;BALANCES_KEY&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;) są zdefiniowane jako stałe. To fundament pod bezpieczne migracje. AI (SAGE) może przeskanować ten plik i dokładnie wiedzieć, które obszary pamięci zostaną naruszone podczas aktualizacji systemu, eliminując ryzyko &quot;osieroconych danych&quot; (orphaned state).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Temporal Checkpointing (Snapshots):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Wykorzystanie &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;50&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;SnapshotMap&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; z &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;64&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Strategy::EveryBlock&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; dla wag governance to mechanizm &quot;Czarnej Skrzynki&quot;. Pozwala on na rekonstrukcję uprawnień w dowolnym punkcie w czasie, co jest niezbędne dla agentów CLERK przy weryfikacji wstecznych roszczeń lub sporów prawnych.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Namespace Isolation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Poprzez wyraźne rozdzielenie &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;50&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;balances&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; od &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;62&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;gov_weights&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, system zapewnia izolację domeny finansowej od domeny decyzyjnej. Nawet jeśli skrypt w języku &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;168&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; operuje na Twoim portfelu, nie ma on automatycznego dostępu do modyfikacji struktury władzy w Twoim EgOS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Migration Integrity Gate:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;VersionItem&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; to strażnik ewolucji. Przechowywanie &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;75&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;ContractVersion&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; bezpośrednio w pamięci pozwala modułowi &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;131&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;migration.rs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; na natychmiastowe wykrycie niezgodności między kodem a danymi, zapobiegając uruchomieniu niekompatybilnego runtime&#39;u na Twoich aktywach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Alias-Driven Clarity:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Użycie aliasów typu (np. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;47&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;BalancesMap&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;60&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;ConfigItem&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;) sprawia, że handlery w &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;95&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;execute.rs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; stają się czytelne dla ludzi i maszyn. Zamiast operować na surowych mapach, programista operuje na &quot;Pamięciach&quot;, co drastycznie zmniejsza szansę na błąd w logice zapisu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
