        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1310" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1002" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The &quot;Sovereign Dispatcher&quot; — Intent Orchestration Matrix&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color&quot; style=&quot;--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;&quot; id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_be868d8e6c20a5b6&quot; aria-live=&quot;off&quot; aria-busy=&quot;false&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;In the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt; language runtime, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;contract.rs&lt;/code&gt; acts as the authoritative dispatcher. It utilizes the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;97&quot;&gt;Sylvia&lt;/b&gt; framework to manifest a strict, type-safe API while maintaining a radical separation of concerns. By centralizing storage handles and delegating all execution, query, and migration logic, it creates a &quot;Transparent Shell&quot; that protects the core state while exposing a unified interface to the outside world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of the Sovereign Dispatcher:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color&quot; style=&quot;--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;&quot; aria-live=&quot;off&quot; aria-busy=&quot;false&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Strict Delegation Architecture:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Moduł ten nie zawiera ani jednej linii logiki warunkowej (if/else). Każde wywołanie jest natychmiast przekazywane do dedykowanych silników (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;172&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;execute&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;181&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;query&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;188&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;migration&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;). To zapewnia, że &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;216&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;contract.rs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; pozostaje niezmienny i łatwy do audytowania jako &quot;Spis Treści&quot; całego systemu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Unified State Access (Handles):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Poprzez zdefiniowanie &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;54&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;pub struct Contract&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; z kompletem uchwytów (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;96&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Item&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;102&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Map&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;107&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;SnapshotMap&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;), dispatcher staje się jedynym właścicielem struktury bazy danych. To tu zapada decyzja o kluczach przestrzeni nazw (Keyspace), co jest fundamentem dla bezpiecznych migracji stanów.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Sylvia-Generated Surface:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Zastosowanie makr &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;44&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;#[sylvia::contract]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; i &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;66&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;#[sv::msg]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; sprawia, że interfejs kontraktu jest generowany automatycznie na podstawie definicji metod. Eliminuje to błędy typu &quot;mismatch&quot; między wiadomością a handlerem, co w języku &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;248&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; jest krytyczne dla zachowania ciągłości intencji.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Snapshotting-Aware Registry:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Inicjalizacja &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;governance_weights&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; przy użyciu &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;74&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;governance_weights_snapshot()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; wewnątrz konstruktora &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;126&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;new()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; wbudowuje mechanizm wersjonowania czasu w samą strukturę kontraktu. Każdy ruch salda jest obserwowany przez &quot;pamięć temporalną&quot;, co pozwala na odczyty stanu z przeszłości.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Administrative &amp;amp; Proof Ingress:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Metody &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;39&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;update_config&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; i &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;55&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;execute_intent&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; są zaprojektowane jako uniwersalne bramy wejściowe. Poprzez obsługę &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;138&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Binary&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; payloadu i opcjonalnych dowodów (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;178&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;proof&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;), dispatcher pozwala na przesyłanie dowolnie złożonych instrukcji języka &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;257&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, zachowując przy tym minimalizm on-chain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
