        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1313" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1002" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;response-container-content ng-tns-c3320883659-714&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;response-content ng-tns-c3320883659-714&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color&quot; id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_6b42492dfe295ec0&quot; aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-busy=&quot;false&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The &quot;Engine Room&quot; — .rice Execution Logic&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;response-container-content ng-tns-c3320883659-714&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;response-content ng-tns-c3320883659-714&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color&quot; aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-busy=&quot;false&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;W runtime&#39;ie języka&amp;nbsp;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;27&quot;&gt;execute.rs&lt;/code&gt;&amp;nbsp;to moduł, w którym instrukcje binarne są procesowane i zatwierdzane. To tutaj &quot;Gatekeeper&quot; (bezpiecznik) spotyka się z &quot;Authority&quot; (uprawnieniami), a każda operacja musi przejść przez rygorystyczny proces walidacji. Moduł ten nie interpretuje wysokopoziomowych celów, lecz egzekwuje niskopoziomowe reguły zapisu do pamięci.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Filary Maszynowni .rice:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;response-container-content ng-tns-c3320883659-714&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;response-content ng-tns-c3320883659-714&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color&quot; aria-live=&quot;polite&quot; aria-busy=&quot;false&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Intent Traceability (SHA-256):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Każda instrukcja (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;49&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;payload&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;) jest haszowana do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;76&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;trace_id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;. To unikalny identyfikator wewnątrz runtime&#39;u, który pozwala na śledzenie cyklu życia operacji od momentu wpłynięcia do bazy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;210&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;proofs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;aż po jej finalizację.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Deterministic Gatekeeping:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Funkcja&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;35&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;ensure_unpaused&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;jest absolutnym warunkiem wstępnym dla każdej mutacji. W języku&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;115&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;bezpieczeństwo jest wpisane w ścieżkę krytyczną wykonania — jeśli runtime jest w stanie wstrzymania, żadna instrukcja (poza administracyjnymi) nie zostanie przetworzona.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Atomic Ledger Management:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;manage_balance&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;operuje na prymitywach&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;64&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;TokenAmount&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, dbając o atomowość zmian. Dzięki&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;110&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;checked_add&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;i&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;124&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;checked_sub&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;system jest matematycznie odporny na błędy przepełnienia, co jest kluczowe dla stabilności księgi (ledger).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Cryptographic Enforcement:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Integracja z&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;40&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;crypto.rs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;pozwala na natychmiastową weryfikację podpisów&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;97&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Ed25519&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(a w przyszłości PQ). Runtime odrzuca każdą próbę wykonania intencji, która nie posiada poprawnego dowodu kryptograficznego zgodnego z ładunkiem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Telemetry Anchoring:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Każdy wynik operacji jest mapowany na&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;59&quot; style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;IntentStatus&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;i emitowany jako zdarzenie. To jedyny sposób, w jaki świat zewnętrzny dowiaduje się o sukcesie lub porażce instrukcji wewnątrz izolowanego środowiska runtime&#39;u.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
