        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1328" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1002" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The &quot;Sovereign Sandbox&quot; — .rice Runtime Simulation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;In the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt; language, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;test.rs&lt;/code&gt; is the ultimate verification engine. It utilizes the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;84&quot;&gt;Sylvia Multitest&lt;/b&gt; framework to create a high-fidelity simulation of the runtime&#39;s behavior. This module ensures that the complex interplay between cryptographic proofs (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;252&quot;&gt;crypto.rs&lt;/code&gt;), state mutations (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;281&quot;&gt;execute.rs&lt;/code&gt;), and emitted facts (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;313&quot;&gt;event.rs&lt;/code&gt;) is perfectly synchronized. It acts as the final gatekeeper, guaranteeing that the &quot;teeth&quot; of the language correctly process intents before they ever touch a live network.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of the Sovereign Sandbox:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Full Intent-Lifecycle Validation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Test &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;39&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;intent_flow_verify_trace_and_events&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; symuluje rzeczywistego aktora. Generuje on parę kluczy Ed25519, tworzy binarny ładunek i weryfikuje, czy runtime poprawnie rozpoznaje dowód, aktualizuje mapę &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;233&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;proofs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; i emituje precyzyjne zdarzenia telemetrii.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Economic Invariant Enforcement:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Poprzez testy takie jak &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;56&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;manage_balance_insufficient_funds_on_debit&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, sandbox weryfikuje matematyczną szczelność księgi. Sprawdza, czy próba wydania więcej niż posiadane zasoby skutkuje natychmiastowym i poprawnym błędem &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;251&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;InsufficientFunds&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, co jest fundamentem stabilności finansowej runtime&#39;u.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Security Gate Rigidity:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Testy autoryzacji (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;update_config_unauthorized_for_non_admin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;) i mechanizmu pauzy (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;105&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;paused_contract_blocks_execute_intent&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;) potwierdzają, że &quot;Bezpieczniki&quot; systemu działają bezbłędnie. Gwarantuje to, że suwerenność runtime&#39;u nie może zostać naruszona przez nieautoryzowanych aktorów ani w sytuacjach awaryjnych.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Event Telemetry Auditing:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Dzięki pomocnikowi &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;45&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;assert_intent_event&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, sandbox sprawdza nie tylko stan bazy danych, ale i sygnały wysyłane do świata zewnętrznego. Upewnia się, że &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;174&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;trace_id&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; i &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;185&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;action&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; w logach są zgodne ze standardem &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;225&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;rice/contract&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, co jest krytyczne dla poprawnej pracy indeksatorów (SMITH).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Macro-Driven Sandbox Deployment:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Użycie &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;40&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;deploy_sandbox!&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; pozwala na błyskawiczne i powtarzalne inicjowanie czystych instancji runtime&#39;u z domyślnie włączonymi flagami ZK/PQ, co drastycznie przyspiesza proces deweloperski i zapewnia stałe warunki testowe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
