        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1334" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1002" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The &quot;Sovereign Anchor&quot; — .rice Module Assembly&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;In the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt; language, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;lib.rs&lt;/code&gt; acts as the definitive anchor and public interface for the entire runtime. It defines the hierarchical structure of the virtual machine, managing the visibility of internal logic and exposing a clean, high-level API to the outside world. By providing a strict mapping of the crate&#39;s layout, it ensures that every component — from the cryptographic &quot;teeth&quot; to the state-transition engine — functions as a unified, deterministic environment for processing signed intents.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of the Sovereign Anchor:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;WASM-Safe Determinism:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Implementacja &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;37&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;wasm_getrandom&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; to krytyczny bezpiecznik. Gwarantuje on, że runtime języka &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;111&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; pozostaje całkowicie deterministyczny wewnątrz łańcucha bloków, uniemożliwiając błędy konsensusu wynikające z prób dostępu do systemowych generatorów liczb losowych.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Module Orchestration Matrix:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Tabela layoutu w dokumentacji to nie tylko opis — to &quot;Mapa Drogowa&quot; systemu. Każdy moduł (od &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;122&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;crypto&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; po &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;132&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;migration&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;) ma przypisaną unikalną rolę, co pozwala na błyskawiczną nawigację i zapewnia, że ewolucja kodu nie naruszy separacji obowiązków (Separation of Concerns).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Escaped Type System:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Poprzez użycie &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;36&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;r#type&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, runtime zachowuje zgodność z nazewnictwem domenowym przy jednoczesnym przestrzeganiu rygorów składni Rusta. Jest to fundamentem czystego API, w którym typy atomowe są odseparowane od mechanizmów ich przesyłania.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Universal Entry Re-exports:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Eksport &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;36&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Contract&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; i &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;47&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;ContractError&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; na najwyższym poziomie pozwala na natychmiastową integrację z zewnętrznymi narzędziami. Dzięki temu język &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;167&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; może być łatwo importowany przez inne biblioteki bez konieczności zagłębiania się w wewnętrzną strukturę modułów.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Telemetry-Ready Exposure:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Publiczna dostępność modułów &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;55&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;msg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; i &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;61&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;event&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; gwarantuje, że systemy zewnętrzne (jak &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;106&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;SMITH&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;) mają pełną definicję &quot;Protokołu Komunikacyjnego&quot; runtime&#39;u, co jest niezbędne dla budowania responsywnych i audytowalnych ekosystemów.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
