        <mxCell id="PHxiAXBZ9Zwz3M3vVkmd-138" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1030" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;align=right;strokeColor=#39FF14;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;policies.rs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="680" x="80" y="2040" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PHxiAXBZ9Zwz3M3vVkmd-139" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1030" style="verticalLabelPosition=bottom;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#39FF14;shape=mxgraph.azure.script_file;pointerEvents=1;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fontStyle=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="39" width="37.05" x="88" y="2040" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PHxiAXBZ9Zwz3M3vVkmd-140" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1030" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The &quot;Sovereign Judiciary&quot; — CEL Compilation &amp;amp; Policy Evaluation&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;In the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt; architecture, the &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;policies&lt;/code&gt; benchmark measures the throughput of &quot;Legal Thought.&quot; Since all actions—from network access to memory pruning—must be validated against a policy, the efficiency of the CEL engine determines the system&#39;s overall latency. This suite ensures that the &quot;Sovereign Judiciary&quot; can render a verdict on any action in nanoseconds, preventing security checks from becoming a bottleneck.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of Sovereign Judiciary Benchmarking:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Lexical Policy Compilation (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;28&quot;&gt;cel_compile&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This measures the time taken to transform a human-readable rule into an optimized Abstract Syntax Tree (AST). While this usually happens during the system&#39;s &quot;Genesis&quot; (boot-up), benchmarking it ensures that the system can dynamically reload security policies without freezing the execution flow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Instruction-Speed Evaluation (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;cel_evaluate&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The core of the system&#39;s defense. By measuring how fast a compiled rule can be checked against a specific context, we ensure that the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;179&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Sovereign Cage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; doesn&#39;t introduce parasitic lag. A fast evaluation allows for &quot;Deep Inspection&quot; where every single packet or syscall is checked against complex logical predicates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Contextual Overhead Management:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The benchmark for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;50&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;root_context&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; initialization provides insights into the cost of gathering system state (environment variables, user IDs, timestamps) for a policy decision. It ensures that the &quot;evidence collection&quot; phase for a policy check is as lean as the &quot;verdict&quot; phase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Stateless Logic Verification:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;CEL&#39;s side-effect-free nature is verified here through repeated execution. By ensuring that the evaluation time remains constant (deterministic), we guarantee that the system&#39;s defensive reflexes are immune to &quot;Timing Side-Channel&quot; attacks where a hacker could guess policy complexity based on execution time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="480" width="600" x="120" y="2120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PHxiAXBZ9Zwz3M3vVkmd-118" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1030" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=mxgraph.basic.document;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#39FF14;fillColor=none;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="560" width="680" x="80" y="2720" as="geometry" />
