        <mxCell id="PHxiAXBZ9Zwz3M3vVkmd-146" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1030" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The &quot;Sovereign Agreements&quot; — Cryptographic Integrity &amp;amp; Contract Identity&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;In the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt; architecture, the &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;contracts&lt;/code&gt; benchmark measures the speed of &quot;Binding Truth.&quot; Since all sovereign agreements and logic extensions are managed through the CosmWasm standard, the efficiency of cryptographic hashing (SHA-256) determines how fast the system can load, verify, and commit contract state. This ensures that the integrity of the system is not just a promise, but a high-speed mathematical constant.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of Sovereign Agreement Benchmarking:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Content Addressable Identity (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;sha256_digest&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This measures the latency of generating unique fingerprints for contract logic and data. By optimizing this path, the system ensures that it can verify the authenticity of every module it loads in microseconds, preventing unauthorized code from executing while maintaining a fluid user experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Deterministic Verification Overhead:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The benchmark proves that the system&#39;s &quot;Identity Check&quot; is deterministic and fast. This is critical for the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;145&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Clerk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, which must verify contract signatures and state hashes before committing any financial transaction to the ledger.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;CosmWasm Lifecycle Hygiene:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;By focusing on the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;47&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;contract::crypto&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; path, the suite ensures that the underlying Wasm environment doesn&#39;t introduce unnecessary overhead when interacting with the host&#39;s native cryptographic instructions. It proves that the &quot;Safe Bridge&quot; between the sandbox and the hardware is optimized for throughput.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Integrity vs. Latency Tradeoff:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The benchmark provides the data needed to tune the system&#39;s security posture. It allows the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;124&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Builder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; to see exactly how much time is &quot;spent&quot; on ensuring integrity, ensuring that the cost of trust remains an order of magnitude lower than the cost of execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="480" width="600" x="120" y="2760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PHxiAXBZ9Zwz3M3vVkmd-117" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-1030" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shape=mxgraph.basic.document;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#39FF14;fillColor=none;" value="" vertex="1">
