        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-307" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-932" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#39FF14;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px; line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;The Near-Metal Orchestrator&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Purpose:&lt;/b&gt; Managing the Zig compilation pipeline and enforcing low-level security quality gates.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Modular Architecture:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; Uses the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;31&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Zig 0.15 API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; to compile the security subsystem into a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;85&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;hermetic static library&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;110&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;libsecurity.a&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;). This artifact is designed for seamless, direct linking into the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;190&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Rust UTIL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; crate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;OS-Level Defense:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; Automatically integrates &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;43&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;pcap&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;49&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;seccomp&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;62&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;LibC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;. These primitives allow the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;95&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; machine to monitor network traffic and filter syscalls directly at the kernel boundary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Verification Gates:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; Implements automated &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;41&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;fmt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;46&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;test&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;, and a custom &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;65&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Deep Walk AST-check&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;. The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;90&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;verify&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; command serves as the final CI &quot;green light,&quot; ensuring no unformatted or syntactically broken code reaches the production warden.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
