        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-313" parent="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-310" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#39FF14;dashed=1;dashPattern=12 12;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 180%; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;The Hermetic Guard&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Purpose:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; Defining the internal, zero-dependency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;core of the security subsystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Hermetic Design:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; Note that &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;27&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;.dependencies = .{}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; is empty. This is intentional. The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;82&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Security Module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; is &quot;Hermetic&quot;—it does not rely on the internet or external packages. This minimizes the attack surface, ensuring that the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;220&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;WARDEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; logic is purely local and fully audited.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Minimal Path Exposure:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; Unlike the root, this manifest only exposes the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;71&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;src&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; directory and its own configuration. This limits the scope of the compiler, focusing all energy on the high-performance Zig source code that protects the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;229&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; kernel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Unique Fingerprinting:&lt;/b&gt; It carries its own unique &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;49&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;.fingerprint&lt;/code&gt; to distinguish the security logic from the orchestrator. If you fork this module or change its internal logic, this fingerprint acts as a &quot;seal of authenticity.&quot;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="600" width="280" x="100" y="159.47000000000003" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
