        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PHxiAXBZ9Zwz3M3vVkmd-209" parent="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-320" style="verticalLabelPosition=bottom;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=center;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#39FF14;shape=mxgraph.azure.script_file;pointerEvents=1;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fontStyle=1;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="39" width="37.05" x="87.96" y="800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PHxiAXBZ9Zwz3M3vVkmd-210" parent="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-320" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The &quot;Immutable Witness&quot; — Cryptographic Evidence &amp;amp; Liability Chain&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;In the &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;.rice&lt;/b&gt; security stack, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;29&quot;&gt;audit.zig&lt;/code&gt; functions as the &quot;Immutable Witness.&quot; It is not a mere logging utility, but a cryptographic notary that creates a tamper-evident chain of every autonomous defensive action taken by the system. By utilizing hash-chaining (SHA-256), it ensures that the sovereign machine’s history cannot be rewritten, providing a &quot;Black Box&quot; record of the system&#39;s survival and its decisions to isolate or prune threats.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of the Immutable Witness:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Tamper-Evident Hash Chaining (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;chain_tip&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Every defensive act — whether a process kill, a memory wipe, or a sandbox lock — is cryptographically linked to the previous state. By maintaining a running SHA-256 hash of the entire history, the Witness ensures that any attempt to delete or alter a past event will break the chain, alerting the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;339&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Clerk&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; to a &quot;History-Manipulation&quot; attack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Self-Reporting Defensive Proofs (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;recordDefensive&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;When the machine acts autonomously to defend its state, it generates a &quot;Defensive Proof.&quot; This removes the &quot;Human-in-the-Loop&quot; delay, allowing the system to act with zero-millisecond latency while simultaneously producing a non-repudiable audit trail that proves the necessity and legality of its actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Autonomous Liability Reporting:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Through the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;44&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;liabilityReport&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; mechanism, the system generates &quot;Sovereign-Grade&quot; documentation before an emergency shutdown. It explicitly identifies the failure and the last known safe phase, acting as a legal shield that proves &quot;Due Diligence&quot; in autonomous operation, shielding the owner from liability for automated defense decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;High-Intensity Stress Auditing (&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;logStress&lt;/code&gt;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The Witness is deeply integrated with the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;86&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Chaos Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;. Every penetration test and stress phase is recorded, creating a library of resilience data. This ensures that the system&#39;s &quot;Security Reflexes&quot; are not just implemented, but continuously proven to be functional through a transparent and audited history of internal attacks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;WORM-Ready Canonical Serialization:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;By formatting events into a canonical string format (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;89&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;kind|ts|detail&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;) before hashing, the module ensures that the audit log is ready for append-only storage media (WORM). This architecture ensures that once an event is recorded, it is &quot;carved in stone,&quot; preventing even a compromised AI from erasing the evidence of its own containment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="600" width="600" x="119.96" y="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PHxiAXBZ9Zwz3M3vVkmd-211" parent="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-320" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;align=right;strokeColor=#39FF14;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;error.zig&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
