        <mxCell id="NetWeRefARGaiRHp-jNh-1200" parent="buZBv7jyl6kujNXGrouv-978" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=1;strokeColor=#39FF14;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=default;fillColor=default;gradientColor=none;" value="&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The &quot;Sovereign Ledger&quot; and the Multi-Asset Wealth Protocol&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;In &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;.rice OS&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;balance.rs&lt;/code&gt; acts as the definitive enforcer of economic equilibrium. It allows for a multi-asset ecosystem where wealth is represented as &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;150&quot;&gt;Shielded Notes&lt;/b&gt;. These notes hide their value, asset type, and owner, yet remain fully auditable through the laws of Zero-Knowledge conservation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Pillars of the Module:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The Shielded Note Architecture:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Every unit of value—be it digital gold, tokenized commodities, or credit—is encapsulated in a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;126&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;ShieldedNote&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;. This note uses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;155&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Pedersen Commitments&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; for the amount and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;195&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Poseidon Digests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; for ownership, ensuring that your balance is a secret shared only between you and the math of the universe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Asset Labeling &amp;amp; Domain Separation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Through &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;44&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;AssetType&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, the OS can handle an infinite variety of assets. Each asset is derived from a human-readable label, creating a distinct cryptographic &quot;lane.&quot; This prevents cross-asset contamination and allows the OS to support everything from grain-backed tokens to legal-bond certificates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The Banker’s Rule (Value Conservation):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The module strictly enforces the fundamental law of finance: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;101&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Inputs = Outputs + Fee&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;. By utilizing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;138&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;ShieldedLedgerTransfer&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, the OS ensures that wealth is never created from thin air during a transfer. Every transaction is balanced and verified through a 64-bit range proof, neutralizing inflation exploits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Minting with Real-World Backing:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;37&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;MintAuthorization&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; protocol links digital liquidity to real-world collateral. It requires a binding attestation from the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;157&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Identity Layer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, ensuring that every new token entering the shielded pool is anchored to a verifiable claim or physical asset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Key Technical Highlights:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Homomorphic Auditability:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; The OS can verify total supply by summing encrypted points on the BN254 curve, maintaining system-wide integrity without compromising individual privacy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Fail-Fast Ledger Validation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(#ffffff, var(--ge-dark-color, #121212)); color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; By performing range and conservation checks before proof generation, the system saves computational resources and provides instant feedback on invalid financial operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="600" width="600" x="120" y="7720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
